{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound by Bones</strong> is a single-player supernatural horror experience where your only way out\u2026 is through fire. Spirits bound to this world by their cursed remains haunt the living\u2014and the only way to banish them is to find their bones and burn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a spiritual investigator tasked with performing the Bone Ritual\u2014an ancient practice to end hauntings by burning the physical remains of vengeful ghosts. Each level drops you into a terrifying location where a spirit has anchored itself to the mortal plane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the ritual, you\u2019ll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the bones</strong> scattered across the area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find salt</strong>, gasoline, and matches\u2014tools needed to purify and destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together clues, survive the haunting, and <strong>burn the remains</strong> to end the curse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Five Levels. Fifty Variants.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by Bones features <strong>five unique haunted environments</strong>, each one with its own layout, challenges, and supernatural ambiance. From claustrophobic interiors to wide, eerie grounds, every level is designed to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it doesn\u2019t stop there. Each level includes <strong>10 different randomized instances</strong>. Objects, key items, and even the ghost\u2019s behavior can change, giving you a fresh experience every time. You\u2019ll never know exactly where to look\u2014or what\u2019s waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains horror elements, frightening scenes, depictions of human remains, and sudden scares that may not be suitable for all players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669640?t=1758597858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669640?t=1758597858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669640/0cf429270b8077816affafb5dedc6260241fa1c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758597858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669640/0cf429270b8077816affafb5dedc6260241fa1c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758597858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Bound by Bones is a psychological horror experience that features intense jump scares, a dark and oppressive atmosphere, and disturbing imagery. The game includes depictions of human remains (bones), implied violence and death, and audio-visual effects designed to unsettle the player.\r\n\r\nThe narrative explores mature themes such as grief, loss, trauma, and the supernatural. Some in-game content may include references to or depictions of suicide and may be distressing to sensitive players.\r\n\r\nPlayer discretion is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3754340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bound by Bones</strong> is a single-player supernatural horror experience where your only way out\u2026 is through fire. Spirits bound to this world by their cursed remains haunt the living\u2014and the only way to banish them is to find their bones and burn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a spiritual investigator tasked with performing the Bone Ritual\u2014an ancient practice to end hauntings by burning the physical remains of vengeful ghosts. Each level drops you into a terrifying location where a spirit has anchored itself to the mortal plane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the ritual, you\u2019ll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the bones</strong> scattered across the area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find salt</strong>, gasoline, and matches\u2014tools needed to purify and destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together clues, survive the haunting, and <strong>burn the remains</strong> to end the curse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Five Levels. Fifty Variants.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by Bones features <strong>five unique haunted environments</strong>, each one with its own layout, challenges, and supernatural ambiance. From claustrophobic interiors to wide, eerie grounds, every level is designed to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it doesn\u2019t stop there. Each level includes <strong>10 different randomized instances</strong>. Objects, key items, and even the ghost\u2019s behavior can change, giving you a fresh experience every time. You\u2019ll never know exactly where to look\u2014or what\u2019s waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains horror elements, frightening scenes, depictions of human remains, and sudden scares that may not be suitable for all players.</p>","developers":["IgnisByteStudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669640/6e89dc9d1221f5a423e5bcb689c69e76ac536a28/header.jpg?t=1758597858","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr